Package: PASTRI
Title: Inferring Cell State Transition Probabilities on Lineage Trees
Version: 0.0.1
Authors@R: 
    c(
      person(
        given = "YourFirstName",
        family = "YourLastName",
        email = "your_email@example.com",
        role = c("aut", "cre"),
        comment = c(ORCID = "0000-0000-0000-0000")
      )
    )
Description: PASTRI infers directed transition probabilities between
    cell states along a lineage tree reconstructed from CRISPR/Cas9
    barcodes or somatic mutations. It estimates pairwise latest
    common ancestor depths, constrains biologically irreversible
    transitions, and returns an optimal transition matrix across
    specified cell types.
URL: https://yuxiaochen11.github.io/PASTRI/,
    https://github.com/yuxiaochen11/PASTRI
